  "overviews": {
    "zh-CN": "提供屏幕操作能力，包括截屏、录屏、获取屏幕信息、多显示器管理、屏幕亮度控制、分辨率查询/设置、鼠标位置追踪等功能。",
    "en-US": "Screen operations including screenshots, screen recording, display info, multi-monitor management, brightness control, resolution query/set, and mouse position tracking."
  },
